### 二、链路 A：union-servo `RegisterAreaUser`

**`union-servo/handler/handler.go:239-266`** — control_flow P4 是唯一写库路径：

| Path | when | 行为 |
|---|---|---|
| P1 | `err != nil && err != gopublic.ErrNotExist` | 查询出错，直接返回 |
| P2 | `err == nil`（已存在） | 返回已有 `userareainfo.UID`，**不创建** |
| P3 | `err != nil`（不存在）但 `RequestAreaServoRegister` 失败 | 返回错误 |
| **P4** | `err != nil`（不存在）且 `RequestAreaServoRegister` 成功 | **调用 `InsertUnionUserAreaInfo`** |

源码（P4 路径经过的完整代码）：

```go
// union-servo/handler/handler.go:239-266
func RegisterAreaUser(uuid uint64, biztype models.BizType, thirdType models.ThirdType, thirdID string, username string, areaType int) (uint64, int, error) {
	// 检查区域用户是否存在
	userareainfo, errcode, err := QueryUnionUserAreaInfoByUUID(uuid, areaType, "")
	if err != nil && err != gopublic.ErrNotExist {
		return 0, errcode, err
	} else if err == nil {
		return userareainfo.UID, errcode, err
	}
	// 注册区域用户
	areauserid, errcode, err := RequestAreaServoRegister(uuid, areaType, thirdID, "", username, int(biztype), thirdType, 0)
	if err != nil {
		return 0, errcode, err
	}
	uid, _ := strconv.ParseUint(areauserid, 10, 63)
	// 更新映射
	if errcode, err = InsertUnionUserAreaInfo(&dbwrap.DBUnionUserAreaInfo{
		UUID:       uuid,
		AreaType:   areaType,
		UID:        uid,
		State:      1,
		CreateTime: time.Now(),
		ModifyTime: time.Now(),
		UpdateTime: time.Now(),
	}, ""); err != nil {
		return 0, errcode, err
	}
	return uid, errcode, err
}
```

`InsertUnionUserAreaInfo` 实现（control_flow P1，无条件调用 `Insert`）：

