### 四、链路 C：union-access `Endpoint.checkUser`

**`union-access/handler/endpoint.go:1052-1076`** — 同样仅在 `err == gopublic.ErrNotExist` 时调用 `RegisterUnionUserToArea`（control_flow P2）：

| Path | when | 行为 |
|---|---|---|
| P1 | `err != nil && err != gopublic.ErrNotExist` | 查询出错，返回 |
| **P2** | `err == gopublic.ErrNotExist`（不存在），`ok`（有 servo 信息），`RegisterUnionUserToArea` 成功 | **最终走到 `InsertUnionUserAreaInfo`** |
| P3 | `err == gopublic.ErrNotExist`，`ok`，但 `RegisterUnionUserToArea` 失败 | 返回错误 |
| P4 | `err == gopublic.ErrNotExist`，`!(ok)`（无 servo 信息） | 返回错误，**不创建** |
| P5 | `err != gopublic.ErrNotExist`（已存在） | 直接用已有 `userareainfo.UID`，**不创建** |

源码：

```go
// union-access/handler/endpoint.go:1052-1076
func (endpoint *Endpoint) checkUser() (model.GlobalErrCode, error) {
	if userareainfo, _, err := QueryUnionUserAreaInfoByUUID(endpoint.cache.UUID, endpoint.arearesinfo.AreaType, endpoint.cache.FlowID); err != nil && err != gopublic.ErrNotExist {
		vlog.Errorf("Endpoint.checkUser(). query union user area info failed. ...")
		return model.GerrAllocAreaESReadFailure, errors.New("query user area info failed")
	} else if err == gopublic.ErrNotExist {
		if info, ok := endpoint.aapinfo[dbwrap.AreaPointTypeInnerServo]; ok {
			// 注册区域用户
			if userareainfo, _, err := RegisterUnionUserToArea(info.OuterIpv4Address, info.OuterPort, endpoint.cache.FlowID, endpoint.cache.UUID, endpoint.arearesinfo.AreaType); err == nil {
				endpoint.cache.UID = userareainfo.UID
			} else {
				vlog.Errorf("Endpoint.checkUser(). register union user to area failed. ...")
				return model.GerrAllocAreaRegisterAreaUser, errors.New("register area user failed")
			}
		} else {
			vlog.Errorf("Endpoint.checkUser(). area servo point outer info not exist. ...")
			return model.GerrAllocResolveAAPInfo, errors.New("query servo point outer info failed")
		}
	} else {
		endpoint.cache.UID = userareainfo.UID
	}

	return 0, nil
}
```

